      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like there’s nothing left. everything i worked for, all those years of studying and the research, it’s just gone. like i was only ever defined by what my brain could do, and now that i’ve failed... it feels like the person i was doesn't even exist anymore. just a shell. what is the point of even being here if the part that mattered is dead?",
